{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13213170","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13213170","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1321317001:1":{"text":"你们是刚才的客人！太好了……请一定要帮帮我！","source_cn":"你们是刚才的客人！太好了……请一定要帮帮我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD955A508438245E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321317002:1":{"text":"别着急，慢慢说，究竟发生了什么事？","source_cn":"别着急，慢慢说，究竟发生了什么事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51186269AB247141","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321317003:1":{"text":"是野狼！这附近有野狼出没！","source_cn":"是野狼！这附近有野狼出没！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x656C79537CCC1E8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321317004:1":{"text":"我领着驯鹿往白熊旅店运货，原本好好走在路上……可没想到路边突然窜出来好几只野狼！","source_cn":"我领着驯鹿往白熊旅店运货，原本好好走在路上……可没想到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F1C2C9DAA468C3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321317005:1":{"text":"驯鹿受到惊吓，踹了那些野狼好几脚，我这才趁机逃了出来。本想去旅店求援，但我的腿受了伤，疼得要命，根本跑不起来……","source_cn":"驯鹿受到惊吓，踹了那些野狼好几脚，我这才趁机逃了出来。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x702EE74D87F92BD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321317006:1":{"text":"——幸好遇到了你们！求求你们，帮我赶走那些野狼，救救驯鹿吧！要是驯鹿受伤、还弄丢了货物……瓦迪姆老板肯定不会放过我的！","source_cn":"——幸好遇到了你们！求求你们，帮我赶走那些野狼，救救驯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD9B3493F584C3AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321317007:1":{"text":"驯鹿和那些野狼在哪？","source_cn":"驯鹿和那些野狼在哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB571F464FB1FBE20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321317008:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">沿着小路往北</style>，就能看到它们了！女神在上……保佑驯鹿和货物千万不要出事！","source_cn":"<style=highlight>沿着小路往北</st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x677E92849A82444A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:运货员工":{"text":"运货员工","source":"运货员工","status":"source"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"漫漫","source":"漫漫","status":"source"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"满满","source":"满满","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}